Third-party marks

The artwork in src/icons/marks/ is each brand's own and only names its product. The marks belong to
their owners; using one names the product and doesn't brand anything else. Where each came from is in
src/icons/marks.json (`source`).

lobe-icons (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons)
  The engine and provider marks whose `source` names lobe-icons are taken from
  @lobehub/icons-static-svg 1.102.0, unchanged but for their file format, in each brand's colored
  version where there is one. Hermes wears Hermes Agent's mark.
